{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "座前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "假也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "假也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗即假也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文廣不引。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然律師同在下答。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人我、\n法我"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此謂鈍根正得人空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此謂鈍根兼得法空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天台光明文句記雖云曇無德部計，然撿成論，但有折色觀耳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下四三觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然律師答此，反斥資持，未知得\n何文義。餘所斥者，其類若此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以被論唯\n識觀，𢌞向後心方修故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此與法華懺等是同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此通兩重\n真俗，並是即事而修，正與補助儀能禮所禮性空寂等理觀同也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣有記文\n避繁不引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然。師不答。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然師同下，合答。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然師\n在下答。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼宗觀俗，不顯即理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論中五地\n已前，真俗別觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外凡\n十信"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內凡三十心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二地至七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八地至佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此收資糧四十心，并暖四加行人，合名願樂地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於信樂後引加行故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝加行歸信樂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信、住、行、向"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "暖、頂、忍、世\n第一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心真如門、心生滅門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即空觀也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即假觀也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即中觀也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出楊律師義圖，彼總出九家，立宗不同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0707001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0707001", "type": "mod", "text": "俊芿皈國後守一作答釋遙寄於日本國其答釋載在終南家業卷上末"}
